WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.960
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.000 --> 01:35.720
Whatever kind of person I am,

01:35.800 --> 01:37.840
that's what
the Prince of Duan's daughter is.

01:37.920 --> 01:39.160
You don't get to judge.

01:39.760 --> 01:40.960
Today,

01:41.040 --> 01:43.240
I'll purge the traitor
for the Prince of Duan!

01:45.800 --> 01:47.480
What a loyal subordinate,

01:47.560 --> 01:49.480
to murder his lord's
sole surviving daughter.

01:49.560 --> 01:51.840
Would you have his line end with me?

02:05.160 --> 02:07.160
I shouldn't have trusted you.

02:07.720 --> 02:10.720
To think you would give up
your title as the county princess

02:10.800 --> 02:12.160
to seek revenge with me.

02:12.240 --> 02:13.800
I have been

02:13.880 --> 02:15.080
way too foolish.

02:16.680 --> 02:18.160
You are indeed foolish.

02:19.560 --> 02:21.800
On the day I hosted the banquet
to kill the Right Chancellor,

02:22.320 --> 02:24.320
the Imperial Guards surrounded my mansion.

02:24.400 --> 02:27.240
Did you truly believe your safe escape

02:27.760 --> 02:30.160
was solely the work of your patron?

02:30.240 --> 02:32.280
After that, the murders in the palace

02:32.360 --> 02:33.880
and the nursery rhyme
in the Western Capital…

02:33.960 --> 02:35.560
You charged ahead,

02:35.640 --> 02:37.240
while he schemed in the shadows.

02:38.000 --> 02:41.080
You thought he was plotting
the great cause with you,

02:41.600 --> 02:42.960
but have you ever wondered

02:43.480 --> 02:45.560
why he chose you, of all people?

02:46.360 --> 02:48.680
Because we both wanted Cui Minzhong dead,

02:48.760 --> 02:51.720
and I happened to be
the sharpest blade he could wield.

02:51.800 --> 02:53.400
With such formidable power,

02:53.480 --> 02:54.840
what kind of blade couldn't he find?

02:54.920 --> 02:57.360
It's only because I chose you.

02:57.880 --> 02:59.480
He only valued

03:00.000 --> 03:02.160
your status as my father's
former subordinate.

03:03.600 --> 03:04.880
If the plan succeeds,

03:04.960 --> 03:07.680
you will be eliminated
because you know too much.

03:08.200 --> 03:09.520
If it fails,

03:10.160 --> 03:11.760
you will be the perfect scapegoat.

03:13.160 --> 03:15.360
Do not fabricate lies out of thin air.

03:17.880 --> 03:20.200
Haven't you realized
that he has abandoned you?

03:20.920 --> 03:23.720
Do you think assassinating Consort Shu
is some act of righteousness?

03:23.800 --> 03:28.240
It is just the perfect way
to pin all the blame on you.

03:29.120 --> 03:30.800
Would he care about
my grievance over the loss

03:31.960 --> 03:33.760
or your suffering from injustice?

03:34.280 --> 03:37.240
It's nothing but a chess game
to take down the Cui family.

03:37.800 --> 03:39.080
On the chessboard,

03:39.600 --> 03:40.760
everyone is a pawn.

03:43.000 --> 03:44.640
I can't kill Consort Shu

03:45.160 --> 03:46.760
nor can I bear to kill you.

03:47.280 --> 03:48.720
As long as he remains,

03:49.240 --> 03:51.080
revenge can still be achieved.

03:51.160 --> 03:53.200
Then why don't we make a bet?

03:54.080 --> 03:55.280
He must have promised

03:55.360 --> 03:57.760
to escort you out once the job is done.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.480
Then let's see

04:00.000 --> 04:01.640
who he sends.

04:01.720 --> 04:02.960
Someone to help you escape

04:03.600 --> 04:05.560
or the Imperial Guards for your arrest.

04:05.640 --> 04:07.040
If you win,

04:07.120 --> 04:08.440
I will let you go

04:08.520 --> 04:11.240
and stop standing in the way
of your revenge.

04:11.800 --> 04:12.800
And if I win…

04:14.040 --> 04:14.920
What do you want?

04:15.520 --> 04:16.800
I will surely win.

04:22.440 --> 04:25.240
Prepare the prize. Now, we shall see.

04:39.760 --> 04:41.280
A CALM BREEZE, A CLEAR MOON

04:46.040 --> 04:49.000
We heard Consort Shu was attacked
and came as soon as possible.

04:49.080 --> 04:51.360
The General of the Imperial Guards
has come in person?

04:52.880 --> 04:55.240
Consort Shu went to rest,
and there was no assassin.

04:55.840 --> 04:57.960
Just a petty thief. I already caught him.

04:58.040 --> 04:59.360
So don't worry.

04:59.960 --> 05:00.840
You caught him?

05:03.040 --> 05:06.360
Where is he? We can take him into custody.

05:08.040 --> 05:09.760
It's too late.

05:11.400 --> 05:14.960
That man was bold enough
to cause trouble in Consort Shu's palace.

05:15.040 --> 05:17.320
I've cut him into pieces right away

05:17.400 --> 05:18.400
and fed him to the dogs.

05:20.040 --> 05:21.640
Your Ladyship, please stop teasing me.

05:21.720 --> 05:23.320
We are here on orders.

05:23.400 --> 05:26.080
We must do our job
and take him back with us.

05:28.840 --> 05:30.200
In that case,

05:30.800 --> 05:31.720
it is tricky.

05:32.240 --> 05:33.400
I don't want to make things hard for you.

05:34.080 --> 05:36.400
How about this? Take me back.

05:36.480 --> 05:37.520
I will explain to him.

05:37.600 --> 05:40.360
- What…
- And it will be my chance to see

05:40.880 --> 05:42.680
whose orders you are following.

05:45.720 --> 05:46.680
Please forgive us.

05:47.200 --> 05:50.480
We merely heard there was an assassin
in Consort Shu's palace

05:50.560 --> 05:52.360
and came to protect Her Highness
and Your Ladyship.

05:52.440 --> 05:55.080
Her Highness is fine, and so am I.

05:55.160 --> 05:56.760
The petty thief is dead.

05:56.840 --> 05:58.480
What else concerns you?

05:59.920 --> 06:02.600
We still need to see
the body to be certain.

06:02.680 --> 06:04.400
Didn't you hear me?

06:04.480 --> 06:05.720
I fed him to the dogs.

06:06.600 --> 06:09.000
Do you want me to cut
the dogs open to reassure you?

06:10.200 --> 06:11.120
I dare not.

06:15.480 --> 06:16.600
Rest assured, Your Ladyship.

06:16.680 --> 06:18.480
Tonight, we shall guard outside

06:18.560 --> 06:20.440
and stay alert.

06:24.720 --> 06:26.040
The Right Chancellor has just fallen,

06:26.560 --> 06:28.400
and someone is here
to surround Consort Shu's palace.

06:29.280 --> 06:31.440
How swiftly the times change.

06:32.120 --> 06:35.640
But Consort Shu
is His Majesty's consort, after all.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.640
Whose power

06:39.440 --> 06:41.000
are you trying to usurp?

06:42.400 --> 06:43.480
We dare not, Your Ladyship.

06:44.000 --> 06:46.040
We were merely overanxious out of concern.

06:46.120 --> 06:48.200
We didn't mean to displease you.

06:48.280 --> 06:49.760
We will leave right away.

06:50.280 --> 06:51.360
Our regards to Her Highness.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.320
What's wrong?

07:03.400 --> 07:04.280
You know him?

07:06.320 --> 07:08.520
Just two days ago, we were allies.

07:09.040 --> 07:11.560
But today, he wants me dead.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.040
Fine.

07:17.080 --> 07:18.200
Kill me if you want.

07:19.120 --> 07:20.200
My life is yours.

07:21.280 --> 07:22.600
I don't want your life.

07:23.120 --> 07:25.520
But I can help you seek vengeance.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.840
Your Ladyship.

07:31.920 --> 07:33.880
The mastermind wants him dead.

07:33.960 --> 07:35.560
Keep him safe

07:35.640 --> 07:36.720
at the Palace Investigation Bureau.

07:36.800 --> 07:39.080
Make sure he confesses to all his crimes.

07:39.760 --> 07:40.600
Understood.

07:54.840 --> 07:57.040
Did you suspect that I'd hurt Consort Shu?

07:58.600 --> 08:00.360
I was sure you had a plan.

08:01.440 --> 08:02.400
Then why are you upset?

08:04.760 --> 08:05.640
Boss.

08:06.360 --> 08:08.160
You've been planning for so long.

08:09.440 --> 08:11.200
Will you finally be able to take revenge?

08:14.920 --> 08:16.920
It might happen soon.

08:18.320 --> 08:19.440
Then I'm happy.

08:23.040 --> 08:24.560
Go check on Mr. Xiao.

08:24.640 --> 08:26.440
He's been waiting for you.

08:26.520 --> 08:27.880
Considering his slight frame,

08:27.960 --> 08:30.080
he may fall ill again
if he waits any longer.

08:49.400 --> 08:52.800
You've had a hard day, Mr. Xiao.

08:52.880 --> 08:54.240
I'm sorry I made you suffer.

08:55.080 --> 08:56.040
It's alright.

08:57.160 --> 08:59.760
I shouldn't have involved you in this.

09:00.600 --> 09:01.560
I'm very glad

09:02.800 --> 09:04.240
that you involved me.

09:30.960 --> 09:32.800
I knew you would understand.

09:32.880 --> 09:35.480
I didn't believe
that you would hurt Consort Shu

09:35.560 --> 09:37.880
with Chen Luo just for revenge.

09:38.480 --> 09:39.920
The fingertip blade you left me

09:40.000 --> 09:41.760
showed that you hoped I could

09:41.840 --> 09:43.000
escape and help you.

09:44.720 --> 09:47.400
The only one you ever
wanted revenge against

09:47.480 --> 09:48.880
was the Right Chancellor.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.720
I had to add fuel to the fire

09:50.800 --> 09:54.000
to force him into your chess game.

09:57.160 --> 09:58.080
No one understands me

09:58.160 --> 09:59.600
as you do.

10:02.440 --> 10:04.760
But there's one thing I don't understand.

10:04.840 --> 10:05.880
What?

10:05.960 --> 10:08.840
The fireworks. How did you pull it off?

10:10.520 --> 10:12.880
I distracted my opponent
and used his plan against him.

10:12.960 --> 10:16.120
I caused a commotion at my mansion.

10:16.200 --> 10:17.920
It lured the Right Chancellor

10:18.000 --> 10:19.920
and those who'd long been watching him.

10:20.520 --> 10:21.360
So,

10:21.440 --> 10:23.840
someone seized upon mine
and Chen Luo's desire for vengeance

10:23.920 --> 10:25.320
to carry out his own scheme.

10:26.080 --> 10:28.040
While Chen Luo held back from me,

10:28.120 --> 10:30.760
I was quietly investigating
what he was doing.

10:30.840 --> 10:32.360
Before the Grand Festival,

10:32.440 --> 10:34.480
you realized he was preparing fireworks.

10:36.200 --> 10:37.320
Instead of stopping him,

10:37.400 --> 10:38.640
I turned his plan to my advantage.

10:39.160 --> 10:41.120
I changed the phoenix solo dance

10:41.200 --> 10:43.240
into the "Dragon and Phoenix
in Blissful Harmony".

10:48.160 --> 10:49.160
Pretty, wasn't it?

10:51.960 --> 10:52.800
Yes.

11:01.920 --> 11:04.480
What fate joins our necks
as mandarin ducks,

11:05.520 --> 11:08.560
soaring together, wing to wing?

11:12.000 --> 11:13.120
Since His Majesty is at ease,

11:14.160 --> 11:15.400
I can rest my mind.

11:23.800 --> 11:25.280
Thank you for trusting me.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.360
Thank you

11:30.320 --> 11:31.480
for trusting me, too.

11:50.120 --> 11:51.560
CUI'S MANOR

12:06.400 --> 12:09.520
ONE TRUE MASTER IS ENOUGH

12:35.160 --> 12:36.320
There you are.

12:37.880 --> 12:38.720
Sorry for the wait.

12:39.520 --> 12:41.320
What a festive attire.

12:42.600 --> 12:44.240
What are we celebrating?

12:45.520 --> 12:47.120
It's the 15th day of the first month.

12:47.200 --> 12:48.040
The Lantern Festival.

12:52.600 --> 12:54.880
If I remember correctly,

12:55.840 --> 12:58.000
you never celebrate the Lantern Festival.

12:59.960 --> 13:01.440
This is an exception.

13:04.640 --> 13:05.880
You brought your sword?

13:08.280 --> 13:09.240
As always.

13:09.320 --> 13:10.720
Are you here

13:11.840 --> 13:13.080
to kill me?

13:16.200 --> 13:17.240
Yes.

13:19.720 --> 13:21.880
Does His Majesty know?

13:23.520 --> 13:25.280
Does Consort Shu know?

13:28.880 --> 13:30.160
Cui Minzhong, the disgraced official,

13:32.160 --> 13:33.080
accept the decree.

13:37.480 --> 13:40.280
A few days away from court,
and you've forgotten your manners?

13:40.840 --> 13:42.160
Accept the decree on your knees.

14:15.080 --> 14:16.720
I, Cui Minzhong, the sinned official,

14:17.600 --> 14:18.880
accept the decree.

14:23.240 --> 14:25.240
"By thorough investigation,
it has been found

14:25.960 --> 14:27.400
that for many years,
the Right Chancellor Cui Minzhong

14:27.480 --> 14:30.560
has sold offices and bartered ranks,
formed cliques for selfish ends,

14:30.640 --> 14:33.400
and framed the loyal ministers
to eliminate dissent.

14:34.400 --> 14:36.480
Sixteen years ago,
he forged an imperial decree

14:36.560 --> 14:37.920
and murdered the entire household
of the Prince of Duan.

14:38.520 --> 14:40.240
To conceal his crimes,

14:40.320 --> 14:43.440
he relentlessly pursued
and harmed the royal descendants.

14:43.960 --> 14:46.760
Now, with his crimes exposed,
to stay alive,

14:46.840 --> 14:49.240
he has resorted to vile sorcery,

14:49.760 --> 14:50.920
slaughtered the innocent,

14:51.520 --> 14:54.000
cursed the nation's fate,
and plotted rebellion.

14:54.800 --> 14:55.840
His accumulated evils

14:56.440 --> 14:58.040
are too numerous to record.

14:59.520 --> 15:01.840
He is hereby granted death.

15:03.520 --> 15:04.800
Let those in charge carry it out."

15:11.960 --> 15:13.000
I'm wronged.

15:14.320 --> 15:15.400
I'm wronged.

15:16.280 --> 15:17.360
Li Peiyi.

15:17.880 --> 15:19.080
You set me up.

15:19.880 --> 15:21.440
This talk of vile sorcery

15:22.040 --> 15:23.840
is a baseless accusation!

15:23.920 --> 15:25.000
You…

15:26.880 --> 15:28.960
- You…
- I'm sure you have received

15:29.040 --> 15:32.400
countless rewards
over the decade, Right Chancellor.

15:33.640 --> 15:35.440
Were you so overjoyed
by the death sentence

15:35.520 --> 15:37.360
that you forgot all propriety?

15:38.640 --> 15:39.480
Show your gratitude.

15:42.440 --> 15:44.440
I-I must see His Majesty.

15:44.960 --> 15:46.960
I must see Consort Shu.

15:47.040 --> 15:49.200
Do not think that this imperial decree

15:49.280 --> 15:50.560
allows you to distort the truth.

15:51.600 --> 15:54.120
I never harbored rebellious intent.

15:54.200 --> 15:57.240
You and Xiao Huaijin
conspired to frame me.

15:57.840 --> 16:00.120
I did everything out of self-defense.

16:03.280 --> 16:04.640
I have been here,

16:05.160 --> 16:07.000
copying sutras in repentance,

16:08.200 --> 16:09.880
confined in reflection.

16:10.840 --> 16:11.760
His Majesty

16:12.360 --> 16:14.200
will forgive me.

16:14.880 --> 16:16.800
His Majesty won't kill me.

16:18.160 --> 16:19.920
I've done so much for His Majesty.

16:20.000 --> 16:21.960
He can't kill me.

16:22.840 --> 16:24.600
You have committed countless evil deeds.

16:25.120 --> 16:28.800
The retribution is now before you.

16:28.880 --> 16:29.720
Are you finally scared?

16:30.320 --> 16:31.360
Am I scared?

16:32.160 --> 16:33.280
Of what?

16:33.880 --> 16:35.920
Why would I be scared
of a young maiden like you?

16:36.000 --> 16:38.280
Your father lost to me. So will you.

16:40.640 --> 16:42.280
I only regret one thing.

16:43.040 --> 16:45.520
I shouldn't have asked
Consort Shu to raise you

16:46.040 --> 16:48.120
and allowed you to be a threat.

16:50.520 --> 16:51.680
I really enjoy

16:51.760 --> 16:53.400
your whole act of bluffing

16:53.480 --> 16:54.840
and the empty threats.

16:56.640 --> 16:59.600
When you were rising high,
basking in His Majesty's favor,

17:01.840 --> 17:03.600
your hands were drenched in blood,

17:03.680 --> 17:05.599
yet you paid no price.

17:06.119 --> 17:07.800
But you've lost His Majesty's favor.

17:07.880 --> 17:08.720
DEATH

17:08.800 --> 17:10.560
I bet you didn't expect

17:11.960 --> 17:13.720
that death comes on a breath.

17:14.240 --> 17:15.520
I must see His Majesty.

17:17.480 --> 17:18.720
I must see His Majesty.

17:19.359 --> 17:20.640
I must see His Majesty.

17:20.720 --> 17:22.200
Without his imperial decree,

17:22.720 --> 17:24.400
no one shall lay a finger on me.

17:33.240 --> 17:35.960
What do you intend to tell His Majesty?

17:36.760 --> 17:38.520
The injustice you suffered?

17:39.120 --> 17:40.680
Your bitterness and grievances?

17:41.760 --> 17:44.920
Thanks to you, I've tasted
all of that, over and over again.

17:46.640 --> 17:48.200
When you stole justice from me,

17:49.080 --> 17:50.720
His Majesty didn't intervene.

17:50.800 --> 17:52.120
What makes you think

17:52.880 --> 17:54.320
you deserve justice for yourself?

17:58.240 --> 18:00.280
When you stood above all others,

18:00.360 --> 18:01.560
looking down on everyone,

18:02.520 --> 18:04.560
did you ever feel sorry
for my late parents?

18:05.080 --> 18:06.360
Did you ever feel sorry for me?

18:06.440 --> 18:07.680
No, you didn't.

18:08.280 --> 18:11.040
You believed that those
who oppose you shall perish,

18:11.120 --> 18:13.080
and we brought it all upon ourselves.

18:13.680 --> 18:15.200
You killed so many people

18:15.720 --> 18:16.560
without a shred of remorse.

18:16.640 --> 18:19.600
It's your turn now.
Why are you so terrified?

18:20.600 --> 18:23.240
Did you think you'd live forever?

18:23.840 --> 18:25.360
Did you think you could take lives

18:25.880 --> 18:28.240
and never pay with your own?

18:30.600 --> 18:32.360
You can't kill me.

18:33.720 --> 18:34.960
You can't kill me.

18:35.560 --> 18:37.160
Why can't I kill you?

18:38.080 --> 18:41.040
You ordered the water-clock apprentice
to slow our water clock.

18:41.120 --> 18:43.040
You made my father miss his appointment,

18:43.120 --> 18:44.160
disturbing His Majesty.

18:44.240 --> 18:46.560
When His Majesty ordered you
to bring my father,

18:46.640 --> 18:49.280
you forged an imperial decree
and slaughtered everyone.

18:50.120 --> 18:52.440
Fortunately, my father
had handed in his command tally,

18:52.520 --> 18:54.080
proving his loyalty.

18:54.680 --> 18:56.240
Seeing that your plan failed,

18:56.320 --> 18:57.880
you killed the eunuch sent from the palace

18:57.960 --> 19:00.280
and made up a lie
about my father going mad,

19:00.360 --> 19:02.800
resisting arrest,
and slaughtering everyone.

19:07.400 --> 19:08.960
He left me no choice.

19:09.760 --> 19:12.680
The Prince of Duan left me no choice.

19:15.280 --> 19:17.480
I kept reaching out in goodwill,

19:17.560 --> 19:19.600
but he met me
with opposition at every turn.

19:21.760 --> 19:23.000
If I didn't kill him,

19:23.520 --> 19:25.040
sooner or later,

19:26.440 --> 19:28.000
he would kill me.

19:30.560 --> 19:33.360
Military men kill with swords and blades.

19:33.960 --> 19:34.800
Civil officials

19:35.640 --> 19:37.560
kill with their minds.

19:37.640 --> 19:38.840
Both are killers.

19:39.800 --> 19:41.440
There is no noble or base.

19:41.520 --> 19:44.760
The victor becomes king,
the vanquished a bandit. That's all.

19:44.840 --> 19:47.200
What could a mere woman like you

19:48.080 --> 19:50.160
know of the power struggles

19:50.680 --> 19:52.240
and the stratagems?

19:53.000 --> 19:55.600
When your men threw me into
the Moonlit Pond, I was only 8 years old.

19:56.240 --> 19:58.640
You violated even
the Five Constant Virtues.

19:58.720 --> 20:00.040
A civil official?

20:00.120 --> 20:02.600
You are nothing but a vicious,
treacherous minister,

20:03.360 --> 20:05.480
a power-grasping in-law
of the royal clan who abuses his power.

20:17.720 --> 20:20.280
So you knew all along.

20:21.040 --> 20:23.120
You've spent all these years

20:23.720 --> 20:25.640
scheming with such effort

20:27.000 --> 20:28.440
just to kill me.

20:31.720 --> 20:34.360
If you hadn't inherited
your father's stubbornness

20:35.400 --> 20:37.480
and had learned
to read the tides and adapt,

20:38.080 --> 20:41.040
we wouldn't end up in mutual ruin.

20:42.040 --> 20:45.240
You were raised under my sister's care.

20:45.840 --> 20:49.040
We could have been close like family.

20:51.320 --> 20:53.600
And you've come to force my hand, too.

20:58.520 --> 21:00.240
Li Peiyi.

21:00.320 --> 21:02.120
How dare you hurt me?

21:02.200 --> 21:04.080
Don't you dare mention

21:04.920 --> 21:06.160
Consort Shu or my father.

21:09.640 --> 21:10.520
I can't die.

21:12.440 --> 21:13.680
I won't die.

21:14.400 --> 21:16.360
I must see His Majesty.

21:19.000 --> 21:20.040
I must…

21:20.560 --> 21:22.360
I must see His Majesty.

21:22.440 --> 21:24.600
ONE SUPREME TALENT SUFFICES

21:35.400 --> 21:36.920
As the daughter of the Prince of Duan,

21:37.560 --> 21:38.960
I can't kill you.

21:40.240 --> 21:42.320
Because I must abide
by the law of the Great Tang.

21:48.680 --> 21:49.600
As an Inner Guard,

21:50.200 --> 21:51.560
I can't kill you.

21:51.640 --> 21:53.280
Because the stability
of the court must be preserved.

22:00.240 --> 22:03.800
I sought justice within the rules,

22:04.360 --> 22:06.960
only to find you standing above them.

22:07.720 --> 22:08.880
You grew reckless in your triumph,

22:09.480 --> 22:10.600
thinking I couldn't do anything to you.

22:26.360 --> 22:28.600
You thought the court relied on you

22:29.160 --> 22:30.640
and His Majesty favored you.

22:31.160 --> 22:32.960
You thought no one dared to cross you.

22:35.760 --> 22:37.640
Then I shall make the court fear you

22:38.160 --> 22:39.320
and His Majesty despise you.

22:40.080 --> 22:41.880
You thought you sat secure
in your high position,

22:41.960 --> 22:43.240
basking in His Majesty's favor.

22:45.240 --> 22:48.000
Then I shall give His Majesty
a reason to kill you.

22:52.000 --> 22:53.280
You thought

22:54.000 --> 22:56.680
you stood above the rules of this world?

22:58.760 --> 23:00.800
Then I will turn your rules against you

23:03.720 --> 23:04.560
and kill you with them.

24:45.520 --> 24:47.560
You handled this matter well.

24:47.640 --> 24:48.600
A reward is due.

24:49.120 --> 24:51.720
But any reward from me
might be ill-fitting.

24:51.800 --> 24:54.040
So just tell me what you want.

25:01.520 --> 25:02.680
Your Majesty,

25:03.200 --> 25:05.760
whatever you grant Her Ladyship
will be appreciated.

25:06.360 --> 25:07.880
It lacks novelty for Her Ladyship

25:07.960 --> 25:09.960
to demand something.

25:10.040 --> 25:12.040
We await Your Majesty's decree.

25:15.280 --> 25:16.320
Li Peiyi.

25:17.200 --> 25:18.200
I decree

25:18.280 --> 25:20.280
that you shall oversee
the Palace Investigation Bureau.

25:20.360 --> 25:21.520
What do you say?

25:23.240 --> 25:24.640
I am unruly by nature

25:25.160 --> 25:27.520
and unworthy of such a responsibility.

25:29.680 --> 25:31.760
Is it that you are unworthy

25:32.360 --> 25:34.040
or that you are unwilling?

25:34.920 --> 25:38.320
Did you really think of it as a tool
for your private investigations?

25:38.840 --> 25:39.760
You want to quit now?

25:40.440 --> 25:43.280
I only feel ashamed.

25:44.040 --> 25:45.480
Even if I uncover the truth,

25:46.000 --> 25:48.400
I'm rarely allowed to bring it to light.

25:49.800 --> 25:52.240
I investigate cases
and hold trials by the laws,

25:52.840 --> 25:55.040
only to find that the laws

25:55.120 --> 25:56.800
are nothing but tools of the royal clan.

25:56.880 --> 25:58.480
The laws punish the multitude,

25:58.560 --> 25:59.840
but not the royals.

26:01.480 --> 26:03.520
Within the inner palace,

26:03.600 --> 26:05.360
I no longer know
how to conduct an investigation.

26:06.520 --> 26:09.040
I beg Your Majesty's forgiveness.

26:09.120 --> 26:10.600
I am truly unworthy
of such responsibility.

26:16.160 --> 26:18.720
Are you accusing me
of bending the law for personal gain?

26:19.840 --> 26:22.240
The entire realm
is Your Majesty's private domain.

26:22.320 --> 26:24.120
How can there be any "personal gain"?

26:25.560 --> 26:26.760
Li Peiyi.

26:27.840 --> 26:29.520
Do you truly believe

26:29.600 --> 26:30.720
I'm unaware of your schemes?

26:30.800 --> 26:33.200
I have tolerated you, accommodated you,

26:33.280 --> 26:35.400
and even allowed you
to execute Cui Minzhong.

26:35.480 --> 26:36.400
You are still displeased?

26:39.280 --> 26:42.720
Your Majesty knew of Cui Minzhong's
countless, unforgivable crimes,

26:42.800 --> 26:44.280
each deserving a thousand deaths.

26:44.880 --> 26:46.480
Yet you still chose to shield him.

26:47.080 --> 26:48.640
Without your favoritism,

26:48.720 --> 26:51.520
I wouldn't have waited until today
to seek justice for my family.

26:53.120 --> 26:55.640
Do you wish to be reunited
with your parents?

26:57.480 --> 26:59.520
You have just cleared my father's name.

27:00.120 --> 27:02.080
How could you execute
his only surviving daughter?

27:02.680 --> 27:03.960
Even if you feel no pity for me,

27:04.560 --> 27:06.880
surely you care about your own reputation.

27:12.440 --> 27:13.920
Get lost.

27:14.000 --> 27:15.240
Get out of here.

27:15.320 --> 27:16.720
Don't ever come back.

27:16.800 --> 27:17.640
Get lost.

27:24.640 --> 27:27.600
I lack the fortune to deserve your grace.

27:29.040 --> 27:30.640
But I will always be grateful to you

27:31.720 --> 27:32.880
for raising me.

28:27.040 --> 28:28.040
Your Highness.

28:35.160 --> 28:36.000
You're leaving?

28:39.960 --> 28:43.440
I always knew this day would come.

28:45.240 --> 28:46.960
You don't even ask where I'm going?

28:48.880 --> 28:50.200
Wherever you wish to go

28:50.720 --> 28:54.600
must be a place where you can find shelter
and peace of mind.

29:01.720 --> 29:02.640
Your Highness.

29:02.720 --> 29:04.200
Come with me.

29:04.760 --> 29:07.160
This place is suffocating.

29:09.320 --> 29:10.880
This is my place of shelter.

29:11.560 --> 29:14.040
But does it bring you peace?

29:14.560 --> 29:15.800
This is not a home.

29:17.160 --> 29:18.520
How can it not be?

29:22.040 --> 29:23.840
I am His Majesty's consort.

29:24.600 --> 29:26.360
This is the home His Majesty gave me.

29:26.960 --> 29:28.400
Always trying to read his mind,

29:28.920 --> 29:30.640
always having to wear a smiling face…

29:31.240 --> 29:32.920
That is not what a wife should do.

29:33.440 --> 29:35.600
Favor and fall from grace
can change in a single dawn.

29:35.680 --> 29:37.600
That is not what a wife deserves.

29:38.320 --> 29:39.600
Come with me.

29:40.280 --> 29:41.720
I will take care of you.

29:42.320 --> 29:44.360
With the edge of jade
and the heart of orchids.

29:44.880 --> 29:46.440
You have your own name.

29:47.040 --> 29:48.560
You don't have to be Consort Shu.

29:49.080 --> 29:50.280
You are Cui Yuyao.

29:58.160 --> 30:00.520
Nobody has called me Yuyao
for a long time.

30:06.200 --> 30:08.400
You've done what you had to do.

30:08.920 --> 30:10.760
But I haven't.

30:11.840 --> 30:13.760
His Majesty needs a Consort Shu.

30:14.480 --> 30:16.040
The Cui family needs a Consort Shu.

30:16.640 --> 30:18.560
To ease His Majesty's anger

30:18.640 --> 30:20.200
and preserve the Cui family,

30:20.280 --> 30:22.000
I must stay here

30:22.600 --> 30:23.720
to atone for my brother's sins.

30:24.320 --> 30:27.160
But His Majesty and the Cui family
never truly cared about you.

30:27.680 --> 30:29.280
Why must you live for them?

30:31.520 --> 30:33.040
Peiyi, I am not like you.

30:35.000 --> 30:38.080
I do not know for whom to live

30:38.760 --> 30:40.200
if not for His Majesty

30:41.240 --> 30:42.960
or the Cui family.

30:44.720 --> 30:46.400
I lost "me" a long time ago.

30:47.040 --> 30:48.480
All that's left is "Consort Shu".

31:07.200 --> 31:08.360
Don't worry.

31:10.160 --> 31:11.280
I will live well.

31:15.440 --> 31:16.480
You must also

31:18.240 --> 31:19.760
live well.

31:28.280 --> 31:30.560
ETERNAL RENEWAL IN IMPERIAL SPLENDOR

31:30.640 --> 31:32.120
What do you have to say?

31:32.640 --> 31:34.000
Are you also resigning?

31:36.000 --> 31:36.840
Yes.

31:36.920 --> 31:38.920
I handed in my resignation days ago.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.120
I'm grateful for your appreciation.

31:40.200 --> 31:41.840
I now take my leave.

31:48.080 --> 31:51.240
Get out of here with Li Peiyi.

31:51.840 --> 31:53.360
Thank you, Your Majesty.

32:30.640 --> 32:31.960
Li Peiyi.

32:35.840 --> 32:38.400
Xiao… Xiao Huaijin, how dare you!

32:39.080 --> 32:40.640
You've grown some nerves.

32:44.760 --> 32:45.880
Your Ladyship.

32:45.960 --> 32:47.040
Mr. Xiao.

32:47.560 --> 32:49.040
There are people around.

32:49.120 --> 32:51.880
Mind your words and conduct.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.200
- Mind our words and conduct.
- Mind our words and conduct.

32:56.280 --> 32:57.480
- Your Ladyship.
- Mind our words and conduct.

32:57.560 --> 33:00.120
- Mind our words and conduct.
- You must not jest with me.

33:00.200 --> 33:00.920
Who is Mr. Xiao?

33:01.000 --> 33:02.880
- His Majesty will criticize me.
- Who's Your Ladyship?

33:02.960 --> 33:04.040
- Who's Your Ladyship?
- Your Ladyship!

33:04.120 --> 33:05.480
Please stop.

33:09.960 --> 33:10.880
Please.

33:10.960 --> 33:12.600
Mind your conduct.

33:12.680 --> 33:15.080
Mind your conduct.

33:16.520 --> 33:17.400
What…

33:38.000 --> 33:39.120
Bravo.

33:43.840 --> 33:45.640
Bravo!

33:45.720 --> 33:46.960
Bravo.

34:00.760 --> 34:01.760
Last night,

34:03.120 --> 34:04.240
I had the same dream again.

34:07.960 --> 34:09.800
I was in the dark,

34:11.679 --> 34:13.880
with only a faint glimmer of light
in the distance.

34:30.520 --> 34:32.159
Why are you taking my rabbit lantern?

34:34.639 --> 34:36.000
Father?

34:36.600 --> 34:37.760
Mother?

34:38.280 --> 34:39.880
The Lantern Festival is over.

34:39.960 --> 34:41.239
So we're taking the lanterns off.

34:41.840 --> 34:43.920
That's right.
The Lantern Festival is over.

34:44.520 --> 34:46.800
The Lantern Festival is over?

34:56.880 --> 34:58.680
Father and Mother told me

35:00.880 --> 35:01.960
that the Lantern Festival

35:03.560 --> 35:04.680
is over.

35:15.240 --> 35:16.160
It's been hard on you.

35:18.880 --> 35:20.120
You've waited

35:21.200 --> 35:22.400
16 years for this day.

35:25.360 --> 35:26.840
But dawn always comes.

35:28.680 --> 35:29.920
I will stay with you

35:30.680 --> 35:32.080
on this day every year

35:33.120 --> 35:34.040
until dawn.

36:29.120 --> 36:30.760
To Boss.

36:33.600 --> 36:34.880
One more time.

36:34.960 --> 36:35.800
One more time.

36:36.440 --> 36:37.800
To Boss.

36:42.400 --> 36:43.320
Sit.

36:48.920 --> 36:50.840
The case of the Imperial Food Service

36:53.520 --> 36:54.360
is yours.

36:55.520 --> 36:56.560
Really?

36:58.600 --> 36:59.760
Thanks, Boss.

37:06.840 --> 37:08.120
Who could be craving

37:08.720 --> 37:10.440
the frozen delicacy in this deep winter?

37:10.520 --> 37:11.680
I searched everywhere for it.

37:14.960 --> 37:17.160
Well, of course…

37:17.240 --> 37:19.880
It's the boss who wants it.

37:24.800 --> 37:25.840
There you go.

37:43.400 --> 37:44.480
Thanks, Boss.

37:59.120 --> 37:59.960
Lan'er.

38:00.040 --> 38:00.960
How many pots is this now?

38:01.040 --> 38:03.240
You're going to burn
all my monthly stipend.

38:03.320 --> 38:05.960
Martial arts are hard to learn.

38:06.040 --> 38:08.800
So is medicine.

38:10.680 --> 38:13.000
Fine, let's go
for fried sweet-dough pockets.

38:13.080 --> 38:13.960
Really?

38:16.840 --> 38:17.760
Let's go out of the palace.

38:24.680 --> 38:28.280
PENGLAI TERRACE

38:31.480 --> 38:32.440
Your Highness.

38:36.000 --> 38:38.040
It's the Lantern Festival again.

38:38.680 --> 38:40.480
I hope everything is fine

38:41.560 --> 38:42.520
over there.

38:45.120 --> 38:45.960
I caught you.

38:46.040 --> 38:47.360
I caught you.

38:47.440 --> 38:49.280
Come catch me!

38:49.360 --> 38:51.200
I caught you.

38:51.280 --> 38:52.760
- Don't run.
- Come!

38:52.840 --> 38:54.520
Come on!

38:55.920 --> 38:57.080
Don't run.

38:57.160 --> 38:59.520
- Don't run.
- Stop there.

38:59.600 --> 39:01.440
Wait! Stop there!

39:05.400 --> 39:06.560
Wuren.

39:10.840 --> 39:12.440
It's freezing out here.

39:14.320 --> 39:15.200
Come with us

39:15.280 --> 39:16.760
for some nice tavern food.

39:21.360 --> 39:22.200
Don't worry.

39:22.280 --> 39:23.880
They're playing dice. They won't notice.

39:27.080 --> 39:28.680
Look at that! How nice.

39:32.480 --> 39:34.720
Look at that!

39:34.800 --> 39:36.320
A dragon!

39:36.400 --> 39:37.840
- There's a snake!
- A snake!

39:37.920 --> 39:39.120
- Look at that.
- Over there!

39:39.200 --> 39:40.040
So beautiful.

39:40.120 --> 39:41.120
Look at that one!

39:41.200 --> 39:42.240
That one.

39:42.320 --> 39:43.280
It's over there!

39:43.360 --> 39:45.160
That one looks like you!

39:46.840 --> 39:48.440
Great music.

39:48.520 --> 39:50.120
- Excellent.
- Nice.

39:50.200 --> 39:55.960
- Nice.
- Bravo!

39:57.800 --> 40:00.840
- Bravo.
- Bravo.

40:00.920 --> 40:01.760
Brilliant.

40:01.840 --> 40:03.640
- One more.
- One more song!

40:06.080 --> 40:07.120
I finally saw her performance.

40:23.760 --> 40:24.640
Jin Niang.

40:26.920 --> 40:28.560
- What brings you here?
- It's the Lantern Festival.

40:28.640 --> 40:30.000
I just made this. Try some.

40:37.480 --> 40:38.400
Alright.

40:40.160 --> 40:41.240
Let me try them.

40:45.720 --> 40:46.880
Is it good?

40:47.760 --> 40:48.680
Climb the tree?

40:48.760 --> 40:49.880
I don't know how.

40:50.400 --> 40:51.840
- I will teach you how.
- Hey, kids.

40:51.920 --> 40:53.960
Slow down, kids.

41:09.840 --> 41:10.920
Take it easy.

41:12.600 --> 41:13.760
Yi'en.

41:13.840 --> 41:15.720
Have you recited today's texts?

41:17.240 --> 41:18.080
Mother.

41:18.160 --> 41:19.200
It's a festival today.

41:19.280 --> 41:20.720
Please stop quizzing me.

41:21.240 --> 41:23.280
Let me perform
a sword dance for you instead.

41:24.720 --> 41:25.560
Go ahead.

41:52.680 --> 41:54.200
Why did you come here?

41:55.280 --> 41:57.200
Don't tell me you covet my beauty.

42:00.760 --> 42:01.960
You are so skilled at painting eyebrows.

42:02.600 --> 42:04.800
Could you do ours too?

42:10.560 --> 42:11.400
Alright.

42:13.040 --> 42:15.280
Though none of you
can compare to my looks,

42:16.000 --> 42:18.080
painting my own brows
every day does grow dull.

42:19.440 --> 42:21.480
A hundred beauties, a hundred brows.

42:22.000 --> 42:22.840
Let me do yours.

44:32.200 --> 44:35.640
THE END

47:12.200 --> 47:13.040
Your Highness.

47:14.160 --> 47:15.760
How did His Majesty decide?

47:16.280 --> 47:17.480
Chen Luo confessed to all charges.

47:17.560 --> 47:18.560
Cui Minzhong is dead.

47:18.640 --> 47:21.280
Consort Shu is going to pray
in seclusion when spring arrives.

47:22.720 --> 47:24.240
What about Li Peiyi and Xiao Huaijin?

47:24.760 --> 47:27.200
They both resigned
and left the Western Capital today.

47:28.680 --> 47:29.920
They left?

47:32.200 --> 47:33.960
But they know

47:34.800 --> 47:35.880
far too much.

47:42.880 --> 47:44.600
Kill them all. Spare no one.

47:45.840 --> 47:47.240
Yes, Your Highness.
